'''Oda Nobunaga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]] event. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.9 Update|Version 2.0.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]] increases health, damage and freeze duration. [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]] increases health, number of knockbacks, adds [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] targeting and gains [[Surge Attack#Counter-Surge|Counter-Surge]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]].

