==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Oda Nobunaga was a part of another [[Cat Combo]] called [[The First Vajiras (Removed Combo)|The First Vajiras]].
*[[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]] increased Oda Nobunaga's range from 390 to 410.
*Immortal and Phantasmal Nobunaga have the longest freeze duration of all Cats.
*This is the first Cat to have the [[Surge Attack#Counter-Surge|Counter-Surge]] ability.
*This Cat is a tribute to [[wikipedia:Oda Nobunaga|Oda Nobunaga]], a Japanese historical figure from the Warring States Period.
**The supernatural aspects of Oda Nobunaga (specifically Wargod Nobunaga) is a recurring trope in fiction where Oda Nobunaga is portrayed as a dark entity with demonic powers. Due to him likening himself to the demon Mara, carrying out the burning of Mt. Hiei, and generally not being particularly respectful to tradition or Buddhists, he is not portrayed favorably given the prominence of Buddhism in Japan, and thus his historical demonic allusions are taken literally.
*The temple located at the bottom of Oda Nobunaga represents the [[wikipedia:Honnō-ji|Honnō-ji Temple]], where he committed suicide. This is also referenced in his only Cat Combo, namely [[Honnoji's Curse (Combo)|Honnoji's Curse]].
*The samurai located above Oda Nobunaga's head resembles that of [[wikipedia:Akechi Mitsuhide|Akechi Mitsuhide]], his protégé that notoriously tried to murder him.

